  "central_question": "Does examplimab improve joint outcomes in biologic-naive active PsA, and how far can we take the result?",
  "objectives": [
    "Interpret the primary effect size together with its confidence interval",
    "Separate pre-specified findings from post hoc and extrapolated claims",
    "Decide what this trial can and cannot change in practice"
  ],
