      "text": "More patients reached ACR20 at week 24 with examplimab than with placebo (58% vs 31%).",
      "kind": "finding",
      "relationship": "causal",
      "evidence_status": "source-backed",
      "source_refs": [
        {
          "source_id": "ficta1",
          "locator": "Table 2",
          "quote": "ACR20 58 (70/120) vs 31 (37/120); 27 pp (15 to 39); p<0.001"
